  "Analysis inclusion": "解析対象の選択",
  "Display and analysis inclusion": "表示・解析対象の選択",
  "Include this sample in multi-sample analyses": "このサンプルを複数サンプル解析に含める",
  "Include this sample in multi-sample analyses and CyTOF compensation Apply": "このサンプルを複数サンプル解析とCyTOF補正の適用対象に含める",
